// Configurable"). GPIO34 tagged "button" - confirmed SW4 (datasheet
// sec 5.11: "SW4 / MCU_I34_SW4 / Software Configurable"). GPIO36
// tagged "button" - confirmed SW3 (datasheet sec 5.11: "SW3 /
// MCU_I36_SW3 / Software Configurable"). GPIO32 (LED6) and GPIO33
// (LED7) are confirmed real onboard LEDs (datasheet sec 5.10
// Indications: "MCU_IO32_LED1 -> LED6", "MCU_IO33_LED2 -> LED7",
// "Software Configurable") but were left UNTAGGED - the datasheet does
// not state on/off polarity and the schematic is not publicly
// available; see boardsDetails/.../imbrios-logsens-v1p1/notes.txt for
// human review.
